穿云 core muse.22 (1.10.4): 测速 faster and more accurate without the false 超时 of congested
home lines coming back.
- One connection per node: connect + TLS + the first HEAD, then up to three HEAD round trips on
  the same kept-alive connection; the median of those (no handshake in it) is the delay, the
  first one is shown at once (urltest.MuseURLTestSamples). 1 connection instead of 4. When the
  server does not keep the connection, one new connection; with no round trip at all the setup
  time is used (a node that answered is never 超时 because a second request failed).
- Timeout tiers: the first try gets 5 s (5/8 of the timeout, 3–5 s) with a second connection
  after 2.5 s without an answer; connection refused / no such host is final at once; a real
  timeout is re-tested 1 s later, ahead of the queue, with three connections and the full timeout.
- Adaptive concurrency: from the configured count (8) +4 after each round without a timeout up
  to 3× (24); three timeouts among the last 8 results drop it back; a network change resets it.
  At most 24 test connections are open at once (1.10.3's 8 × 3); extra ones only within it.
- Nodes with exactly the same configuration (MonitoringOptions.MuseSameAs) are tested once and
  share the result (off after a hot reload); an automatic test reuses a result younger than 60 s,
  测速 / re-tests / invalidated nodes always test.

